# Sitemap — SoftFlex Website
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Navigation between pages

The site is a marketing website for an IT services company, not an application. Navigation follows the MOR Software pattern: a sticky top header with dropdown menus for multi-page sections, and a content-rich footer that mirrors the full sitemap. Two main entry paths drive the structure: by service (what SoftFlex offers) and by industry (who it serves).
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Top header (sticky, persistent across all pages)

A horizontal bar that sticks to the top of the viewport on scroll. Dark background consistent with brand identity (`#0A0E1A`), with a subtle bottom border or blur-backdrop effect when scrolled.

**Layout, left to right:**
- **Logo** (left aligned, links to Home)
- **Nav items** (left grouped after logo): Services, Industries, Case Studies, Contact
- **Primary CTA** (right aligned): "Get in touch" button — links to Contact Us

Hovering the Services nav item opens a mega menu panel. All other nav items link directly to their page.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Mega menu pattern

When a user hovers (desktop) or taps (mobile) the Services nav item, a full-width panel drops down below the header. Each menu item inside the panel is a card with:
- **Icon** (outlined glyph, 1.5px stroke, brand style)
- **Heading** (the page name)
- **Subheading** (one line describing what the page covers)

The panel uses the brand surface color (`#111827`), generous padding, and cards arranged in a row. Hovering a card highlights it with a subtle indigo border tint.

------------------------------------------

**Services mega menu (3 cards):**

1. **Web & Mobile App Development**
   Icon: device/browser glyph
   Subheading: Full-cycle development from scoping to deployment, web and mobile.

2. **Quality Control & Software Testing**
   Icon: checkmark/shield glyph
   Subheading: End-to-end QA and testing to ship reliable, secure software.

3. **IT Consulting**
   Icon: lightbulb or nodes glyph
   Subheading: Strategic technology advisory aligned to your business goals.

------------------------------------------

**Industries nav item:**
Direct link to the Industries page (no dropdown). All four industry verticals are displayed as sections on a single page — no sub-pages.

**Case Studies nav item:**
Direct link to the Case Studies page (no dropdown). All case studies are displayed on a single page — no detail sub-pages.

**Contact nav item:**
Direct link to Contact Us. Also duplicated as the primary CTA button on the right side of the header.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Mobile navigation

On mobile, the top nav collapses into a hamburger icon (top right, alongside the logo on the left). Tapping it opens a full-screen dark panel. The Services item expands as an accordion to show its 3 child cards. Industries, Case Studies, and Contact are direct links. The "Get in touch" CTA stays pinned at the bottom of the panel as a full-width button.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Footer (persistent across all pages)

A multi-column footer that mirrors the sitemap and holds secondary links.

**Column layout (4 columns on desktop, stacked on mobile):**

- **Column 1 — Brand:** Logo, one-line tagline ("End-to-end software development for growth-stage companies"), social links (LinkedIn, GitHub, Twitter/X), company address (Delaware, USA).
- **Column 2 — Services:** Web & Mobile App Development, Quality Control & Software Testing, IT Consulting.
- **Column 3 — Company:** Industries, Case Studies, Contact Us.
- **Column 4 — Legal:** Privacy Policy, Terms of Service. Text only — no links, no destination pages.

**Bottom bar:** Copyright notice, company registration info (MarketGrid LLC, Delaware), and any quality certifications (ISO 9001, ISO 27001 if applicable).

